menu "P4 audio link"

config P4_AUDIO_LINK_ENABLED
    bool "Enable P4-to-S3 monitor PCM link receiver"
    default n
    depends on DDJ_FLX4_HOST_MODE
    help
        Enables the future dedicated P4-to-S3 monitor PCM receiver used by the
        FLX4 USB Audio headphones path. Keep disabled until the I2S bench pass
        proves S3 USB MIDI remains responsive while the PCM link runs.

endmenu
